<title>UK: Sullom Voe oil liftings surge, half to U.S.</title>
<headline>Sullom Voe oil liftings surge, half to U.S.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, July 30 - Brent Blend crude oil loadings from Britain's Sullom Voe terminal rose sharply to 892,402 tonnes in the week ending July 29 from 387,720 tonnes the previous week.</p>
<p>About half the shipments were destined for the United States with refineries in Britain and other northwest European countries taking the rest.</p>
